  "abstract": "H=160 confirmation of the positive H=128 Dynamic MoT setting with stronger basis smoothness (\u03bb_b_curv=3e\u22126) at \u03b1=0.06 and ctx_hidden=64. Tests whether the improved regularization that helped H=128 also helps at higher capacity.",
